    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Her one Weakness</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;When a group of 3000 armed Horde soldiers and sympathizers attack Brightmoon, the castle has to be evacuated and the town is under siege&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In order to let her girlfriend escape, Catra holds the invaders off and gets captured&lt;br /&gt;The invaders hold her hostage in Brightmoon's tallest tower, trying to get the Alliance's location out of her&lt;br /&gt;The Rebellion is hiding out in their old base far out until they can come up with a game plan&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;How will Adora live with knowing Catra could potentially be getting hurt? How will Catra survive being locked up in a tower and interrogated for answers? And how will the Alliance reclaim the hub of the Rebellion?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(TW : This gets violent bois, no death, but there is violence)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
